身份与署名","value","The official ElevenLabs SDK organization uses the ElevenLabs double-bar mark. This is the company mark, not an audio placeholder.","language","en","获取方式","sdk","access","section","源码",[81],{"_61":82,"_25":67,"_83":84},"Official Python SDK","note","API client source only; generation model and complete game source are not included.","interactive","演示",[88],{"_61":89,"_25":90,"_83":91},"Sound effects generator","https://elevenlabs.io/sound-effects","Official text-to-audio generator and sound examples; this is an audio tool, not a playable game.","教程",[94],{"_61":95,"_25":96,"_83":97},"Sound Effects quickstart","https://elevenlabs.io/docs/eleven-api/guides/cookbooks/sound-effects","Official API walkthrough with SDK examples; an account and API key are needed for generation.","来源核查","2026-10-19","verified","metadata","list","适用方向","ordered",false,[108,109],"dimensions","2D","3D","开发阶段",[113],"stages","资产与动画","主题",[117,118,119,120,121,122],"tags","Sound effects","Foley","Ambience","Audio loops","API","Commercial service","延伸阅读",[125,126],{"_61":129,"_25":130},{"_61":127,"_25":128},"Sound Effects API reference","https://elevenlabs.io/docs/api-reference/text-to-sound-effects/convert","Product walkthrough","https://elevenlabs.io/docs/eleven-creative/playground/sound-effects","项目源码",[133],{"_61":131,"_25":134},"https://elevenlabs.io/docs/overview/capabilities/sound-effects","用途与特点","描述脚步、撞击、UI 反馈或环境声，设置时长后导出音频。文档支持循环生成，单段最长 30 秒；概览列出所有音效可用 MP3，非循环音效可用 48 kHz WAV，API 格式与账户方案需另查。循环质量应在目标游戏中检查。公开 SDK 只连接托管 API，不包含生成模型或完整游戏。","detail","guidance","资源类型","工具","分类","游戏制作","category","lead","summary","name","production","tool",[162,163],{"_157":158,"_159":160,"_32":161},[117,118,119,120,121,122],[156],[154,155],"2d","3d","assets","tutorial",{"_61":95,"_25":96,"_17":157,"_83":97},"demo",{"_61":89,"_25":90,"_17":85,"_83":91},{"_61":82,"_25":67,"_17":76,"_83":84},{"_61":129,"_25":130},{"_61":127,"_25":128},{"_165":166},"documents",{"_74":167,"_35":168},[170,174,175,176,1